<title>UK: Daiwa Europe appoints new syndicate head.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Europe appoints new syndicate head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Europe has appointed Simon Crisp as a managing director and head of its non-Japan syndicate alongside Akihiko Kanamura, head of Japan syndicate, the bank said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Crisp joins Daiwa from UBS. In his new position he will report to Jim Siracusa, managing director and head of global debt primary markets.</p>
<p>&quot;The expansion of Daiwa's global fixed income operations will be reflected in a broader syndicate function covering emerging credits and bank capital as well as the firm's traditional investment grade activities,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
